    text: 'This series limited liability company operating agreement (this "Agreement") is dated as of the Effective Date defined in Section 0.1, and is between the following parties:\n(a) INTERDEPENDENT LLC ("INTERDEPENDENT"), a series limited liability company formed and existing under the laws of the State of Delaware, with its registered office in the State of Delaware care of A Registered Agent, Inc., 8 The Green, STE A, Dover, Delaware 19901; and\n(b) the persons whose names and addresses are listed in Attachment M (each a "Member" and collectively the "Members").',
