    mark: null,
    title: 'STATEMENT OF BACKGROUND',
    text: 'A. On March 17, 2017 (the "Formation Date"), Christopher Gilbert Amell, a resident of the Commonwealth of Pennsylvania (the "Executive Director"), caused the certificate of formation of INTERDEPENDENT (the "Certificate of Formation") to be filed with the Secretary of State of the State of Delaware (the "Secretary of State"). On the Formation Date, INTERDEPENDENT was formed under the Delaware Limited Liability Company Act, 6 Del. C. § 18-101 et seq. (the "LLC Act"), as a series limited liability company under § 18-215 of the LLC Act, with the Executive Director as the sole member.\nB. On March 17, 2022, the Executive Director caused an Amended and Restated Certificate of Formation of INTERDEPENDENT to be filed with the Secretary of State, which Amended and Restated Certificate of Formation, together with all subsequent amendments, restatements, and amended-and-restated certificates filed with the Secretary of State from time to time, constitutes the Certificate of Formation. A copy of the Amended and Restated Certificate of Formation as in effect on the Effective Date is attached as Attachment A.\nC. INTERDEPENDENT\'s principal purpose is to bring together large disparate groups of humans and other entities around the execution of ideas powerful enough to motivate and inspire the best efforts of conscious beings.\nD. This Agreement sets forth the agreement of the Members concerning their respective rights and duties as Members and the business, internal affairs, and taxation of INTERDEPENDENT and each Series.\nThe parties agree as follows.',
