    id: 'oa-s17',
    mark: '17',
    title: 'Section 17. Duty of Care',
    text: '17.1 Elimination.\n\nNo Covered Person has a duty of care to INTERDEPENDENT, any Series, or any Member in connection with any act or omission of that Covered Person relating to the management or affairs of INTERDEPENDENT or any Series.\n\n17.2 Liability Floor.\n\nNo Covered Person is liable to INTERDEPENDENT, any Series, or any Member for any act or omission referred to in Section 17.1, except for an act or omission that constitutes (a) Bad Faith, (b) Willful Misconduct, or (c) Knowing Violation of Law.',
