    text: 'The implied contractual covenant of good faith and fair dealing, as preserved by 6 Del. C. § 18-1101(c), applies to this Agreement, to the Economic Attribution Policy, to each Certificate of Establishment, and to every exercise of discretion, right, or authority granted by this Agreement to any Covered Person or Member.',
